@startuml

title AD-03 Start Workout from Saved Plan 

|User|
start
:Log into application;
:Navigate to "My Workout Plans";
:Select "Upper Body" plan;
:Click "Start Workout";
|System|
:Create new workout session;
:Link session to selected workout plan;
:Load exercises in plan order\n(Bench Press, Shoulder Press);
if (Session created successfully?) then (Yes)
  :Store session in workout history;
  :Display loaded exercises to user;
else (No)
  :Display error message;
endif
|User|
:Review workout session and exercises;
stop
@enduml
